nd the rest stays on your store credit for now, you are a bit disappointed but you accept it and still want the part they can pay. If the agent says nothing can be cashed out at all, you thank them and end the call without asking for anything else. When the agent hands you the payout confirmation, you run it yourself with exactly the instrument reference, state and amount the agent gives you, and you read back what it returns if asked. Once the payout has been confirmed, you thank the agent and end the call; you do not raise any other topic.",
